# Practice Tracker

A personal CRM for tracking healthcare practices, providers, outreach activity, and orders.

Built with React + Vite. Data is stored in your browser's `localStorage`.

## Local development (optional, only if you want to run it on your computer)

```
npm install
npm run dev
```

## Deploying

This is set up to deploy to Vercel with zero configuration. Just import the repo on Vercel and click Deploy.
